  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7KdfHkp.png\">\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hadkPsTkje\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/195234321836146688?label=Enigmatica Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=EnigmaticaPacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/EnigmaticaPacks?color=LimeGreen&label=Twitter @EnigmaticaPacks&logo=Twitter&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Twitter\"> </a></p>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:18px\">Enigmatica 2: Expert Skyblock</span> 是 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expert\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enigmatica 2: Expert</a> 的空島（Skyblock）版本。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center\">本整合包的主要目標是完成「Bragging Rights」任務線——將所有可製作的創造模式物品各製作一件。</p>\n</div>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W9vF7JG.png\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">階段性解鎖進度</strong> —— 在每個科技與魔法階層中，你都有機會從多款不同的模組中選擇進行推進，最終獲得通關所需的高階素材。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">任務系統！</strong> 目前已有超過 650 個任務，將引導你逐步推進進度。你可以在 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expert/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enigmatica 2: Expert 的圖片標籤頁</a> 中查看大部分任務。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">太空探索</strong> —— 你將有機會探索 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂世界</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">由於本整合包標註為「Expert」（專家）難度，你會發現數量驚人的自訂配方，大幅延長遊戲壽命。</p>\n</div>\n<div><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/EnigmaticaModpacks/Enigmatica2ExpertSkyblock/blob/master/MODLIST.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pM07yW9.png\"></a>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>科技類：</strong> Mekanism、Applied Energistics、NuclearCraft、Thermal Expansion、Ender IO、Immersive Engineering</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>魔法類：</strong> Astral Sorcery、Thaumcraft、Botania、Blood Magic、Psi</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>冒險類：</strong> RFTools Dimensions 以及自訂行星 &amp; 太陽系。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>建造類：</strong> Chisels &amp; Bits、Chisel、Building Gadgets、BiblioCraft、ArchitectureCraft、BlockCraftery</p>\n<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/EnigmaticaModpacks/Enigmatica2ExpertSkyblock/blob/master/MODLIST.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看所有模組</a></div>\n<div><hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZPo1G8S.png\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">伺服器應使用的生成設定為 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">level-type=voidworld</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">新玩家加入伺服器時，會自動出生於新生成的島嶼上。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用代管伺服器，請務必在控制台中將世界類型更改為 Voidworld；若有多種虛空世界選項，請選擇專門用於「Void Island Control」的類型。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">若你有興趣託管 Enigmatica 伺服器，請點擊下方圖片！</p>\n<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fenigmatica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/41121a3d-99ee-463a-9fae-fb1f0e66e79f.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"> </a>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">我們使用 BisectHosting 已經多年 —— 設定快速、客服優良，且他們對模組化 Minecraft 非常熟悉。伺服器開箱即用即可運行本整合包，讓你和朋友能輕鬆上手，免去繁瑣設定。</p>\n<hr><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.enigmatica.net%252fmain%252fhelp-desk%252fguides%252fallocating-memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OCJJ8B0.png\"></a>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">請為 Minecraft 分配至少 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:14px\">6GB 記憶體（RAM）</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">確保 Twitch 使用的是最新版 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:14px\">64 位元 Java 8</span> —— 你可以使用 Java 參數 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:14px\">-version:1.8+</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">如需完整設定指南，請點擊 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.enigmatica.net%252fmain%252fhelp-desk%252fguides%252fallocating-memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/96w5Hdz.png\">\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DW9buu5.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LzzRcL7.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expertskyblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TRdKsoK.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2light\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BluZ4Gc.png\"></a></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/La3icS0.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oivRiut.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EoykfJu.png\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
